{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "document_id": "ch-finish-reboot",
  "title": "Rebooting the System",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Now that all of the software has been installed, it is time to reboot your computer. However, there are still a few things to check. Here are some suggestions:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Install any"
              },
              {
                "type": "link",
                "href": "https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/view/13.1-systemd/postlfs/firmware.html",
                "label": "firmware"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "needed if the kernel driver for your hardware requires some firmware files to function properly."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Ensure a password is set for the"
              },
              {
                "type": "code",
                "text": "root"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "user."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A review of the following configuration files is also appropriate at this point."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "/etc/fstab"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "/etc/hosts"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "/etc/inputrc"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "/etc/profile"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "/etc/resolv.conf (optional)"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "/etc/vimrc"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Now that we have said that, let's move on to booting our shiny new LFS installation for the first time!"
        },
        {
          "type": "emphasis",
          "text": "First exit from the chroot environment"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ":"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "system_operation_command",
      "index": 0,
      "source_index": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Then unmount the virtual file systems:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "system_operation_command",
      "index": 1,
      "source_index": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If multiple partitions were created, unmount the other partitions before unmounting the main one, like this:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "system_operation_command",
      "index": 2,
      "source_index": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Unmount the LFS file system itself:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "system_operation_command",
      "index": 3,
      "source_index": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Now, reboot the system."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Assuming the GRUB boot loader was set up as outlined earlier, the menu is set to boot"
        },
        {
          "type": "emphasis",
          "text": "LFS 13.1-systemd"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "automatically."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "When the reboot is complete, the LFS system is ready for use. What you will see is a simple"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "login:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "prompt. At this point, you can proceed to"
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/view/13.1-systemd/",
          "label": "the BLFS Book"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "where you can add more software to suit your needs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If your reboot is"
        },
        {
          "type": "emphasis",
          "text": "not"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "successful, it is time to troubleshoot. For hints on solving initial booting problems, see"
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/lfs/troubleshooting.html",
          "label": "https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/lfs/troubleshooting.html"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
